[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Flight-log analysis sidecar (FLA)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-FLA-001
STATUS: Active
STATEMENT: >>>
`POST /v1/analyses` runs the deterministic analyser on a named log from the log library and stores the report; the flight-report routes list the stored reports and return one with its score, findings and parameter sheet.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
VERIFICATION_NOTE: Sidecar `tests/test_app.py`, `tests/test_analysis_view.py`
ALLOCATION: flight-log
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-023

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-FLA-002
STATUS: Active
STATEMENT: >>>
The analysis makes no network call, and the hand-back of applied changes to an external analyser is off unless its address is configured.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test, Inspection
VERIFICATION_NOTE: Sidecar `tests/test_flightmd_client.py`
ALLOCATION: flight-log
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-018

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-FLA-003
STATUS: Active
STATEMENT: >>>
The sidecar only consumes parameter-written events and publishes nothing on command subjects; on an event that carries a recommendation it reports the applied change once.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test, Inspection
VERIFICATION_NOTE: Sidecar `tests/test_applied_changes.py`
ALLOCATION: flight-log
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-017

