STATEMENT: >>>
The station shall take vehicle state only from the gateway stream and shall mark a value as old when its source time exceeds the limit of its category, when a gap is reported, or when frames stop.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: gcs
COMMENT: PR-001.
