- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-GCS-004
STATUS: Proposed
STATEMENT: >>>
The station shall show a visible "simulated" mark on every panel whose data has the simulation flag set or is generated locally.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test, Demonstration
ALLOCATION: gcs
COMMENT: PR-001.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-GCS-005
STATUS: Proposed
STATEMENT: >>>
The station shall send vehicle commands only through the gateway and shall show each as pending, accepted, rejected with its reason, or "state unknown"; it shall not change the displayed vehicle state on its own.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: gcs
COMMENT: PR-003.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-010

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-GCS-006
STATUS: Proposed
STATEMENT: >>>
The station shall show no text that states readiness, clearance, go or no-go, and shall show a compliance item as verified only when it holds the record that proves it.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Inspection
ALLOCATION: gcs
COMMENT: PR-002.
